ility-block__modifier","text":"(+4)"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Saving Throws"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"CON +6, INT +8, WIS +6"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Skills"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover skill-tooltip","text":"History"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"+12,"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover skill-tooltip","text":"Perception"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"+10"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Senses"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover sense-tooltip","text":"Darkvision"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"120 ft.,  Passive Perception 20"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Languages"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"Deep Speech, Telepathy 120 ft."},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Challenge"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"10 (5,900 XP)"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-label","text":"Proficiency Bonus"},{"element":"span","class":"mon-stat-block__tidbit-data","text":"+4"},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Traits"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Amphibious."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The aboleth can breathe air and water."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Mucous Cloud."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"While underwater, the aboleth is surrounded by transformative mucus. A creature that touches the aboleth or that hits it with a melee attack while within 5 feet of it must make a DC 14 Constitution saving throw. On a failure, the creature is diseased for"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"1d4"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"hours. The diseased creature can breathe only underwater."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Probing Telepathy."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"If a creature communicates telepathically with the aboleth, the aboleth learns the creature’s greatest desires if the aboleth can see the creature."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Actions"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Multiattack."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The aboleth makes three tentacle attacks."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Tentacle."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+9"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 10 ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"12"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d6 + 5)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"bludgeoning damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or become diseased. The disease has no effect for 1 minute and can be removed by any magic that cures disease. After 1 minute, the diseased creature’s skin becomes translucent and slimy, the creature can’t regain hit points unless it is underwater, and the disease can be removed only by"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"heal"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"or another disease-curing spell of 6th level or higher. When the creature is outside a body of water, it takes 6"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(1d12)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"acid damage every 10 minutes unless moisture is applied to the skin before 10 minutes have passed."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Tail."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+9"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 10 ft. one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"15"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(3d6 + 5)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"bludgeoning damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Enslave (3/Day)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The aboleth targets one creature it can see within 30 feet of it. The target must succeed on a DC 14 Wisdom saving throw or be magically"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"charmed"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"by the aboleth until the aboleth dies or until it is on a different plane of existence from the target. The"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"charmed"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"target is under the aboleth’s control and can’t take reactions, and the aboleth and the target can communicate telepathically with each other over any distance."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Whenever the"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"charmed"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"target takes damage, the target can repeat the saving throw. On a success, the effect ends. No more than once every 24 hours, the target can also repeat the saving throw when it is at least 1 mile away from the aboleth."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Legendary Actions"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The aboleth can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature’s turn. The aboleth regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Detect."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The aboleth makes a Wisdom ("},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover skill-tooltip","text":"Perception"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":") check."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Tail Swipe."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The aboleth makes one tail attack."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Psychic Drain (Costs 2 Actions)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"One creature"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"charmed"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"by the aboleth takes 10"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(3d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"psychic damage, and the aboleth regains hit points equal to the damage the creature takes."}],"tags":138,"max_dom_depth":7}